1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,210
THE CUSTOMER: Is my latte ready?

2
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:03,567
You are a barista.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,550
THE REGULAR: Name’s Siobhan.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,500
YOU: Latte for… Bird? Eye?

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,700
YOU: Oat! Soy! Almond! Next!

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,060
THE CUSTOMER: Oat latte. Half-caf. Extra hot.

7
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,950
THE CUSTOMER: No foam. Extra foam.

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,950
YOU: No foam… extra… Sure!

9
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,150
THE CUSTOMER: Is my latte ready?

10
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,450
YOU: One oat latte! Extra foam!

11
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,660
THE CUSTOMER: Too foamy.

12
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,200
THE MANAGER: Why is my café a bubble bath?

13
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,660
THE MANAGER: Sold out! Tomorrow, you fix the computers.

14
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,400
THE CUSTOMER: Same again!

